                ['How long does it take, and when can I start?', '<p>Gatehouse publishes hours rather than terms. The figures given are 360 guided learning hours set against a total qualification time of 1,200, the balance being your own study. Start dates belong to the delivering centre, not to the awarding body. Since the qualification runs under an exclusivity agreement, the sensible first step is to confirm which centre is approved to offer it and what intake pattern they operate.</p>', 5],
                ['Is it worth anything outside the UK?', '<p>It is a UK-regulated qualification listed on Ofqual\'s register under QAN 610/7552/8, and Gatehouse approves centres internationally. Recognition by a specific employer, ministry or professional body is their decision rather than something the awarding body can guarantee, so if you need it recognised for a particular licence or a visa route, verify that with the relevant authority before you enrol.</p>', 6],
            ],
