                'Qualifi is unusually direct about who it has in mind: people seeking middle and executive level roles in medium or large corporations. Note the word seeking. This is written for the climb rather than the arrival, for the manager who runs one function well and now needs a working grasp of the other seven before the next job becomes plausible.',
                'Breadth is the design, not a compromise. Nothing here goes as deep as a specialist award in finance or marketing would, and nothing is meant to. The qualification is accredited at Level 7, carries 120 credits, and its number on the framework is 601/7656/8 — an early registration, which makes it one of the longest-standing awards in Qualifi\'s range.',
