                'Qualifi\'s own written summary adds very little. It runs to three sentences, two of which talk about business managers in general terms, and one of those has been mangled somewhere in editing to the point where quoting it would mislead rather than inform. The single clear statement left standing is that the award supports managers working in the tourism and hospitality industry, with a long view of their continued development.',
