            'hero' => 'R, Python and SQL are named on the official page, which no other qualification here does. Behind the tooling sit statistical inference, predictive modelling, time series work and machine learning applied to business questions.',
            'overview' => [
                'Qualifi rarely names a technology. On this award it names three: learners are expected to gain skills in mathematics, statistics and programming in R, Python and SQL. That single sentence tells you more about what the study involves than most listings manage in a page, and it sets a clear expectation about the kind of work you will be doing.',
                'The published subjects run from Exploratory Data Analysis and Statistical Inference through predictive modelling, Time Series Analysis, unsupervised multivariate methods and machine learning. Classical statistics first, then the modelling techniques built on top of it. The stated audience is people aiming at data scientist, data analyst or artificial intelligence roles.',
